flowchart TD
    A[Data collection] --> B{Bias and consent check}
    B -- Issue --> C[Rebalance, document, get consent]
    B -- Ok --> D[Model training]
    D --> E[Fairness eval across groups]
    E --> F{Disparate impact?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Mitigate: reweight, constraints]
    G --> D
    F -- No --> H[Privacy: PII, retention, DP]
    H --> I[Security: misuse, jailbreaks, abuse]
    I --> J[Human oversight + governance]
    J --> K[Deploy with monitoring + audit log]
    K --> L[Incident response and review]
